1840 BM$="Susanna: Are you alright...? You must be weak because you haven't had\anything to eat yet. I'll go fetch something for you. Wait for me, okay?":GOSUB 5100
1850 GOSUB 6300:BM$="Once Susanna left the room, David thought once again about the two dead\men in the basement.":GOSUB 5100
1860 BM$="`Even though I didn't kill them directly, I feel responsible... If I were to\cause more deaths, my heart wouldn't take it...`":GOSUB 5100
1870 BM$="`...But I can't leave the castle either. I can't face the northern tribes alone.\Greg will come back with Jeffs sooner or later... What am I going to do\then...?`":GOSUB 5100
